      "summary": "A three-day new year's retreat in Kabale, Western Uganda, organised by the Rotaract Club of Kampala North and attended by the Rotary Club of Muyenga and its Rotaract Club of KIU. Activities included tree planting around Kigezi Primary School, career guidance, team building and touring the Kigezi sub-region. The retreat was hosted by Prof. Augustus Nuwagaba, President of the Rotary Club of Muyenga.",
