  "notes": "NAMING: Rotary International and the district ClubRunner list the club as 'Kampala-North (Rotaract)' (RI ID 92123). The Rotaract district site uses 'RAC Kampala North'. Instagram uses 'Rotaract Kampala North' and its own posts say 'the rotaract club of Kampala north'. KIU News and the Insight Magazine use 'Rotaract Club of Kampala North'. Recommended display name: 'Rotaract Club of Kampala North'.\n\nDO NOT CONFUSE with (a) the Rotary Club of Kampala North (RI 25541, meets Mondays at Protea Hotel Kololo), (b) the Rotaract Club of Kampala North Musical (RI 214715; DRR 2024-25 Ssebukulu Simeo came from this club), or (c) the Rotaract E-Club of Kampala North (RI 8827515, chartered 2025-08-06, uses #EKANOs).\n\nSPONSOR: not confirmed by any public source.\n\nCURRENT PRESIDENT: conflicting sources (Ezekiel Kiggundu per ClubRunner and Rotary-O, Rogers Waneloba per the RI export). Confirm with the club.\n\nThe district site's 2025 allAfrica article naming DRR 'Aleber Kanyonza' (Rotaract Club of Kigo 7 Lakes) does not state a district. The D9213 org chart gives Abesage Nahabwe as the 2025-26 DRR, so Kanyonza is likely D9214 and is excluded here.\n\nPersonal phone numbers and emails of individuals appear in public district spreadsheets and on Rotary-O. They were deliberately left out of this seed file. Only the club's own email is included.\n\nSocial media activity found publicly is old: the Instagram account's last post is from 22 Nov 2016. Recent club activity probably lives on X, Facebook or WhatsApp, which could not be read."
